{"id":23041,"name":"生命当付之一炬","rarity":5,"path":"Mage","desc":"智识命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"在那幽深的实验之中，总有诸般幻象涌来，拖拽他的脚步。\\n\\n诱惑的呢喃之声说，放下那危险的课题，何必赌上自己的一生。\\n冰冷的威胁之声说，游走在生死边缘的人，终将生命付之一炬。\\n还有那愤怒的指控声，呼喊着将那亵渎神明的罪犯，推入残酷的刑场。\\n\\n<i>「跨越人生的表演，终到了谢幕的时候。」</i>\\n\\n他闭上双眼，握住神明的火种，任凭痛苦淹没濒死的魂灵。\\n先是决绝的眼睛，而后是搏动的心脏，完整的灵魂…他亲手将自己投入那至纯至烈的熔炼之中——\\n\\n诸般声音沸腾，而后化为寂静。\\n一片黑暗中，璀璨的真理在他的手中成型。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23041,"name":"熔炼","desc":"装备者回合开始时恢复<unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak>点能量。若敌方目标拥有装备者添加的弱点，装备者对其造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color>。\\n当敌方目标受到装备者攻击时，装备者使其防御力降低<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>回合。同类效果无法叠加。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0,0.12,0.6,2,10]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0,0.15,0.7,2,10]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0,0.18,0.8,2,10]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0,0.21,0.9,2,10]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0,0.24,1,2,10]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":26.4,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":115011,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":58.08,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110201,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115011,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":100.32,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110202,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115012,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":142.56,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110202,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":115012,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":184.8,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110203,"ItemNum":5},{"